"CRSF also requires a TX6 connection, in addition to RX6, and automatically "
"provides telemetry."
msgstr "CRSF 除 RX6 外还需连接 TX6，并自动提供数传。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-MicoAir743v2.rst:63
#: 0d7fa5d6d1994a088a9055b7a63a2e94 55318196fe3a4addaeac595da4481c41
