"SRXL2 requires a connection to TX6 and automatically provides telemetry. Set"
" :ref:`SERIAL6_OPTIONS<SERIAL6_OPTIONS>` to “4”."
msgstr ""
"SRXL2 需连接 TX6 并自动提供数传。请将 :ref:`SERIAL6_OPTIONS<SERIAL6_OPTIONS>` 设为「4」。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-MicoAir743v2.rst:65
#: 071f861e982549a3823787e2e0258bdf a79dc4a4a33a4daf96c525aa8265c24b
