"Any UART can also be used for RC system connections in ArduPilot and is "
"compatible with all protocols except PPM. See :ref:`Radio Control Systems "
"<common-rc-systems>` for details."
msgstr ""
"ArduPilot 中任何 UART 也可用于 RC 系统连接，与除 PPM 外的所有协议兼容。详情请参阅 :ref:`遥控系统 <common-rc-"
"systems>`。"

