#: e3d9cefc63d4470cb559d544e47329f4 ecee0c97e00e44dba3db4676af1c081d
msgid ""
"The MicoAir743v2 supports onboard OSD using OSD_TYPE 1 (MAX7456 driver). "
"Simultaneously, DisplayPort OSD is available on the HD VTX connector, set "
"OSD_TYPE2 = \"5\"."
msgstr ""
"MicoAir743v2 支持使用 OSD_TYPE 1（MAX7456 驱动）的板载 OSD。同时，DisplayPort OSD "
"可通过高清图传接头使用，设置 OSD_TYPE2 = 「5」。"

